<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style=""><font face="arial"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);">Should only be proactively sent to client’s whose industries need these as a regular ongoing practice – remove this line prior to sending</span><br><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">Good <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">morning/Afternoon</span>,<br><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">As a new client with Insperity you may have immediate or future needs for Workers’ Compensation Certificates. I’d like to proactively share with you some information on this process.&nbsp;<br><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">Accessing this document requires the web role “Liability Administrator”; I can connect you to your <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[payroll specialist name and contact information]</span> if not already in place. Once granted, sign into your Insperity Premier account, then navigate to&nbsp;<a href="https://portal.insperity.com/pcms/regulatory_and_compliance">Company &gt; Regulatory and Compliance.</a>&nbsp;<br><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">From this page you can access information regarding Coverages and Requirements, your area’s claims specialist and request a certificate of insurance.&nbsp;<br></font><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt=""></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br>There are two types of certificates, Standard and Custom. The standard version will not auto renew and is typically used for one-time only purposes. The custom version pertains to certificates you want renewed or that have special requirements.&nbsp;<br><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">If you have questions or need additional support regarding your certificates you may reach out to 281-348-3930.</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">Thank you for trusting Insperity to serve your business.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>